# Redirects for the website (Cloudflare Pages reads this file; so does
# Netlify. GitHub Pages ignores it). scripts/build_site.sh copies it into
# _site/. Deploy notes: docs/WEBSITE_DEPLOY.md.
#
# HOW TO READ IT: each line is  <from>  <to>  <status>.
# 301 = moved for good (browsers and search engines remember it).
#
# Cloudflare already serves /privacy.html at /privacy (and /index.html at /),
# so those need no line here. The lines below catch the other names people
# (and store reviewers) often type for the same pages. Keep this list short:
# a redirect can never point outside this site.

/privacy-policy   /privacy   301
/terms-of-use     /terms     301
/terms-of-service /terms     301
/help             /support   301
/contact          /support   301
